{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21804","headline":"有鸟二十章 十八 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟名鹦鹉，养在雕笼解人语。\n主人曾问私所闻，因说妖姬暗欺主。\n主人方惑翻见疑，趁归陇底双翅垂。\n山鵶野雀怪鹦语，竞噪争窥无已时。\n君不见隋朝陇头姥，娇养双鹦嘱新妇。\n一鹦曾说妇无仪，悍妇杀鹦欺主母。\n一鹦闭口不复言，母问不言何太久。\n鹦言悍妇杀鹦由，母爲逐之乡里丑。\n当时主母信尔言，顾尔微禽命何有。\n今之主人翻尔疑，何事笼中漫开口。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21804.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21804","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}